\": \"A positive test result for nonprescribed fentanyl was defined as detection of norfentanyl (major fentanyl metabolite) or fentanyl not listed as prescribed.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Among 427,915 specimens, 53,969 (12.6%) from patients whose opioid use disorder medication status was inconclusive were excluded from the analyses.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"SAS Studio (version 3.6; SAS Institute) was used to conduct all analyses.\"}], \"confidence\": \"medium\", \"uncertain_fields\": []}", "type": "text"}]}